proj: diyski
desc: SnowTrace - AI-powered ski social platform with trip planning, buddy matching, resort services, and learning management
v: 2.0.0
ts: 2025-12-13T00:00:00Z
split: projects
tech:
  primary_lang: TypeScript|Python
  fw: React|Next.js|FastAPI
  db: PostgreSQL|SQLite|Supabase
