  Snowbuddy Matching,FastAPI,5D buddy matching algorithm,Docker
  User Core,?,User data + Calendar + Auth,Docker
  Knowledge Engagement,?,Skill tracking + courses,Docker
  Single Board Teaching,Next.js 15,CASI-based lesson system,Zeabur
  API Gateway,FastAPI,Request routing & orchestration,Docker
